This software contains derivative works and architectural abstractions originating from
CATerm (https://github.com/cecep-azhar/caterm), created by Cecep Saeful Azhar Hidayat.
All terminal, SSH, SFTP, and networking protocol client dependencies have been decoupled
and removed to establish a generic, modular desktop/mobile application framework.
